{:edb/db-before-t 2220 :edb/db-after-t 2221 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535533 50 #inst "2026-10-09T01:58:08.729Z" 13194139535533 true] [17592186064186 1020 #edb/ref 17592186354001 13194139535533 true] [17592186064793 1100 "Evaluate the integral $\\displaystyle \\int_{0}^{\\pi /2}x\\cos (x)dx$." 13194139535533 false] [17592186064793 1100 "Evaluate the integral ${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x.$" 13194139535533 true] [17592186064793 1145 "Integration by parts with $u=x$, $dv=\\cos x\\,dx$ gives the antiderivative $x\\sin x+\\cos x$. Therefore\n$$\\int_0^{\\pi/2}x\\cos x\\,dx\n=\\left[x\\sin x+\\cos x\\right]_0^{\\pi/2}\n=\\frac\\pi2-1.$$" 13194139535533 false] [17592186064793 1145 "Let's use integration by parts. We set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=x & ⇒ & {u}^{′}=1 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x) & ⇒ & v=\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the integration by parts formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int x\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =x\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)-\\int \\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\cdot 1\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x & =x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x){|}_{0}^{\\pi /2}-{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x){|}_{0}^{\\pi /2}+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x){|}_{0}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =[\\frac{\\pi }{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})-0\\operatorname{sin}⁡(0)]+[\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{2})-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(0)] \\\\  & =[\\frac{\\pi }{2}-0]+[0-1] \\\\  & =\\frac{\\pi }{2}-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535533 true] [17592186354001 1017 #edb/ref 17592186354002 13194139535533 true] [17592186354001 1089 "q-114328" 13194139535533 true] [17592186354001 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535533 true] [17592186354001 1100 "${\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139535533 true] [17592186354001 1113 #uuid "30055505-3f80-5aa5-bd67-0ffdf3305263" 13194139535533 true] [17592186354001 1145 "Let's use integration by parts. We set\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u=x & ⇒ & {u}^{′}=1 \\\\ {v}^{′}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x) & ⇒ & v=\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting the above into the integration by parts formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int u{v}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x & =uv-\\int v{u}^{′}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int x\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x & =x\\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)}{3}-\\int \\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)}{3}\\cdot 1\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate the integral and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}x\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={\\frac{x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)}{3}|}_{0}^{\\pi /2}-{\\int }_{0}^{\\pi /2}\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)}{3}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\frac{1}{3}x\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3x)|}_{0}^{\\pi /2}+\\frac{1}{9}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x){|}_{0}^{\\pi /2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}[\\frac{\\pi }{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{2})-0\\operatorname{sin}⁡(0)] \\\\  & +\\frac{1}{9}[\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{2})-\\operatorname{cos}⁡(0)] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}(-\\frac{\\pi }{2}-0)+\\frac{1}{9}(0-1) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\pi }{6}-\\frac{1}{9}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535533 true] [17592186354002 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354003 13194139535533 true] [17592186354002 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354004 13194139535533 true] [17592186354002 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354005 13194139535533 true] [17592186354002 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354006 13194139535533 true] [17592186354002 1000 #edb/ref 17592186354007 13194139535533 true] [17592186354002 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535533 true] [17592186354002 1041 "selection" 13194139535533 true] [17592186354002 1104 #edb/ref 17592186354005 13194139535533 true] [17592186354002 1110 #uuid "f523db39-2d52-5658-9cf0-7d10756bc9